[PrintTextModified Text:这时，手机响起提示音。|#0101Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Front Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:半梦半醒的艾玛忽然醒来，<br>急匆匆把手机点开。|#0101Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是典狱长的通知。|#0101Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『各位，到晚餐时间了。<br>　请迅速集合到食堂来』|#0101Adv07_Narrative004|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 4：牢の施錠音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:所有的牢房在同一时间解锁了。|#0101Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚餐……|#0101Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，从醒来后就没吃过东西……<br>　肚子饿了……）|#0101Adv07_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然不想接受这样的生活……<br>　可是不吃饭头脑也转不起来）|#0101Adv07_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

