[PrintTextModified Text:食堂在哪里呢……|#0101Adv07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想起【魔女图鉴】里面有地图，<br>于是点开手机。|#0101Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，找到了，食堂在这边……|#0101Adv07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她正要准备跟着地图走，<br>却停住了脚步。|#0101Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:隔壁房好像还有人没动身，<br>有点好奇的艾玛悄悄往里面看了一眼。|#0101Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是城崎诺亚……）|#0101Adv07_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

