; ＠備考◆童謡『ちょうちょ』の鼻歌

[PrintTextModified Text:哼哼哼～哼♪|#0101Adv07_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚一屁股坐在地上，<br>好像在专注做着什么事情。她现在正背对着艾玛。|#0101Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，你好？现在是晚餐时间，你不去吃饭吗？|#0101Adv07_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在铁栅栏外向她说道。|#0101Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚把头转了过来。<br>她手上拿着喷漆。|#0101Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚今天不去吃饭哦？<br>诺亚才刚画到一半呢。|#0101Adv07_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她到底有没有意识到自己被抓了？<br>　感觉她悠哉游哉的……）|#0101Adv07_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那你现在在画什么东西呢？|#0101Adv07_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……你等一下哦。|#0101Adv07_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚站起身来，<br>往旁边移动了一下，好让艾玛看到地面。|#0101Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR13 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！|#0101Adv07_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛发出惊愕的声音。<br>地面上画着的画——竟然自己会动。|#0101Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喷漆画成的不知名图案<br>开始扭来扭去，变化成另一个形状。|#0101Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:转眼间，就变成了蛇的形状。|#0101Adv07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:五颜六色的蛇在地面蠕动着，<br>给人带来恶心的真实感。|#0101Adv07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么回事！|#0101Adv07_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚歪着头，有点为难地微笑着说。|#0101Adv07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么说呢，诺亚的画，会自己动起来。<br>不只是画，只要是液体，都会自己动。|#0101Adv07_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,45 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:本来没想着画蛇的。<br>这下要重新画了。|#0101Adv07_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

