@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（会动……<br>　是因为，用了魔法？）|#0101Adv07_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Noah Category:Profile Version:2

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚重新转过身坐在了地上。<br>艾玛茫然地呆望着她好一阵子。|#0101Adv07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（跟刚才梅露露的手发光<br>　帮我止血的时候一样）|#0101Adv07_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（魔法真的存在吗……？）|#0101Adv07_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管目睹了神奇的现象，<br>但艾玛还是难以相信，不禁摇了摇头。|#0101Adv07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（现在没有功夫慢慢想了……）|#0101Adv07_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……那，那我先走啦。|#0101Adv07_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛朝诺亚的背影说道。<br>接着，在她正准备往上一楼的方向走的时候——|#0101Adv07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:放开我！混蛋！放开我啊怪物！|#0101Adv07_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

