[PrintTextModified Text:她看到看守走下了楼梯，<br>而它的手好像夹篮球一样拦腰扣住了亚里沙。|#0101Adv07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（我记得她，是紫藤亚里沙！？）|#0101Adv07_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:开什么玩笑！凭什么就抓我！|#0101Adv07_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管亚里沙嘴上<br>不依不饶，但是身体却没有表示出反抗。|#0101Adv07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（要是反抗的话……说不定会被杀死）|#0101Adv07_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她——|#0101Adv07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

